<title>RUSSIA: Russia's GAZ carmaker 1996 output up 4.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russia's GAZ carmaker 1996 output up 4.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's OAO GAZ vehicle maker increased overall output by 4.4 percent in 1996 on a year earlier, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It released the following data:</p>
<p>		 GAZ VEHICLE OUTPUT</p>
<p>				     1996	 1995</p>
<p> All vehicles		  209,141    200,292</p>
<p> All trucks		     84,857     81,619</p>
<p>Of that Gazelle light</p>
<p>  trucks/minibuses	    75,503     57,520</p>
<p> Cars			    124,284    118,673</p>
<p>GAZ produces the Volga sedan. The Gazelle is a popular light truck based on the Volga chassis which has also been modified for use as a minibus.</p>
<p>--Peter Henderson, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
